From: DSpine long-context sliding-window fix on SM80
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Disable draft sliding window (8192 -> 262144) to fix long-context collapse

Root cause: with seq > 8192 the FA sliding-window mask branch activates and
produces garbage for this draft on sglang 0.5.22 + SM80 (sgl-kernel fa3
path); collapse boundary moves with the window value (see patch/README.md).
Window >= context length means the mask branch never activates, i.e. plain
causal attention, which is verified correct. Lossless per DSpine paper /
MLX port (draft uses absolute positions + relative rope; windowing exists
only to save compute).

Two changes, applied together (plugin startup validation ties them):

(1) Draft config copy: sliding_window 8192 -> 262144 (= max_position_embeddings).
    Zero-copy layout instead of duplicating the 4.05 GB draft:

      qwen3.8-27b-dspine-b16-fullctx/
      ├── config.json          # edited copy (the diff below)
      ├── model.safetensors -> /path/to/qwen3.8-27b-dspine-b16/model.safetensors
      ├── LICENSE            -> /path/to/qwen3.8-27b-dspine-b16/LICENSE
      └── README.md          -> /path/to/qwen3.8-27b-dspine-b16/README.md

    Then point --speculative-draft-model-path at this directory.

--- a/qwen3.8-27b-dspine-b16/config.json  (original: tencent/Qwen3.8-27B-DSpine-b16)
+++ b/qwen3.8-27b-dspine-b16-fullctx/config.json
@@ -90,10 +90,10 @@
   },
   "rope_scaling": null,
   "rope_theta": 10000000,
-  "sliding_window": 8192,
+  "sliding_window": 262144,
   "tie_word_embeddings": false,
   "torch_dtype": "bfloat16",
   "use_cache": true,
   "use_sliding_window": true,
   "vocab_size": 248320

(2) Plugin constant must match the config copy (startup validation reads it):

--- a/sglang_dspine/layers/attention.py
+++ b/sglang_dspine/layers/attention.py
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 """DSpine serving on SGLang 0.5.22."""

-WINDOW = 8192
+WINDOW = 262144
 BLOCK_SIZE = 16
 NUM_LAYERS = 5
 BACKENDS = frozenset(("fa3",))

Effect (bench_lctx2.py, T=0, single stream, code corpus):
  9229 tok:  accept 1.02 / decode ~22  ->  accept 13.4-14.6 / decode 218
  100K tok:  accept ~1.0 / decode 23.9 ->  accept 7.9-8.2 / decode 129-132
